OL,3,A'I just need that first opportunity':
OL,4,ANew data shows one in eight young
OL,5,Apeople out of work or education
OL,6,
OL,7,FJust under one million people aged 16
OL,8,Fto 24 - 13% of that age group - are not
OL,9,Fin education, employment or training,
OL,10,Faccording to ONS data
OL,12,FToday's figures are lower than those
OL,13,Ffor January to March - but 3% higher
OL,14,Fthan for the same period last year
OL,16,FWe've been hearing from young people -
OL,17,FRebecca tells us she felt "quite stuck"
OL,18,Fafter college, Muhammed says he just
OL,19,Fneeds that "first opportunity"
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
